OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Improvise, adapt and overcome',
OL,4,Asays veteran who lost both legs in IED
OL,5,Ablast
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow 46, he said he was now determined
OL,8,Fto show others how to "adapt to and
OL,9,Fovercome" the challenges they face in
OL,10,Flife.
OL,12,F"I joined the military to get out in
OL,13,Fthe world and have an adventure and I
OL,14,Fstill want that from the outdoors,"
OL,15,Fsaid Clement, from Clitheroe but who is
OL,16,Fnow living Fleetwood in Lancashire.
